Data Deletion Instructions (JITA WhatsApp Agent)

If you want us to delete your personal data from JITA, you can request this at any time.

How to Request Deletion

To delete your data, simply contact us using one of the following methods:

Email: matthewmitchellb@gmail.com
WhatsApp: Message the JITA agent and request “delete my data”

Please include:

The phone number you used with JITA (your WhatsApp number)
A clear request stating that you want your data deleted
What Happens After You Request Deletion

Once we receive your request:

We will verify that the request comes from the correct WhatsApp number
We will permanently delete your stored personal data associated with your account
This includes:
Chat history linked to your number
Stored conversation context
Any files or messages you previously sent (where stored)

We may retain:

Anonymous, non-identifiable logs used for system performance and security monitoring

These logs cannot be linked back to you.

Processing Time

We aim to process all deletion requests within 7 to 14 business days.

Important Notes
Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone
Some information may remain in secure backups for a limited period before being automatically removed
We may retain minimal records if required by law or for fraud prevention
